            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.9.1</h2>
<p><b>Reliability &amp; diagnostics.</b> A small maintenance release that makes
Jarvis better at recording what went wrong if a background sync hits a rare
internal error — so problems get pinpointed and fixed faster.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Improved crash diagnostics for Telegram sync: if the underlying Telegram
      engine hits an internal error, Jarvis now captures the exact details
      instead of failing silently with no trace.</li>
  <li>No changes to your data, settings, or what leaves your Mac.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
